{"schemaVersion":1,"id":205,"sections":[{"id":"356001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20535],"start":0,"count":33},{"id":"356001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20536],"start":33,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:1","scriptId":20535,"text":"死水夏威夷科研基地——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:2","scriptId":20535,"text":"一队钢舞姬正在科研基地的沙滩对岸，看上去好像在休息的样子——是死亡彗星小队","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:3","scriptId":20535,"text":"“莉安娜队长怎么还没搞定，都进去快四个小时了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:4","scriptId":20535,"text":"乔娜·马歇尔等得好像有点不耐烦了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:5","scriptId":20535,"text":"“你问我有什么用，或许队长遇到了什么麻烦事？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:6","scriptId":20535,"text":"莎娃踢飞了脚边的空瓶，在空中划出一道漂亮的弧线后空瓶“噗通”一声掉进了海里，那是莎娃刚才喝完的饮料瓶。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:7","scriptId":20535,"text":"就在两人闲得发慌之际，一位身着红色军装的钢舞姬向她们高速驶来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:8","scriptId":20535,"text":"“终于回来了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:9","scriptId":20535,"text":"是死亡彗星的队长莉安娜·弗洛森。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:11","scriptId":20535,"text":"“怎么？才等这点时间就不耐烦了？在干活的可是我啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:12","scriptId":20535,"text":"说着莉安娜把手伸进自己的背包，从里面拿出了一个文件夹。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:13","scriptId":20535,"text":"“东西已经搞到了，准备出发，趁着波西娅她们还没有发现离开这里。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:14","scriptId":20535,"text":"“波西娅即使发现了也不会想到是你偷的吧，她的东西经常乱丢乱放，偶尔有找不到的东西也挺正常的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:15","scriptId":20535,"text":"“话是这么说没错，但至少这份空钢的设计图并没有被乱丢乱放，撬开波西娅的保险箱可花了我不少时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:16","scriptId":20535,"text":"“在队长进入科研基地的这段时间里，一共有6支小队先后到达。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":860,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:17","scriptId":20535,"text":"“很好，我就喜欢乔娜你的谨慎。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":860,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:18","scriptId":20535,"text":"莉安娜把文件夹又放回了背包里。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":860,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:19","scriptId":20535,"text":"“该去和那帮情报官碰头了，天色也不早了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":860,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:21","scriptId":20535,"text":"于是死亡彗星小队便匆匆离开了科研基地。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:22","scriptId":20535,"text":"但就在通过她们最后一个哨塔的时候，被拦了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:23","scriptId":20535,"text":"“嗯？你这是什么意思，蕾贝卡？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:24","scriptId":20535,"text":"和她们来的时候不同，哨岗的检查人员竟然是蕾贝卡。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:25","scriptId":20535,"text":"“因为前面的路段正在进行军事演练，所以推荐你们绕路走。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:26","scriptId":20535,"text":"“我都没接到过通知，怎么就突然进行演练了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:27","scriptId":20535,"text":"“因为就是临时的啊，我正在培训他的队伍呢，如果莉安娜你不忙的话也来帮个忙如何？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:28","scriptId":20535,"text":"从哨塔里又走出了另一个人。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:29","scriptId":20535,"text":"“呃……真是不好意思，蕾贝卡非要在这里进行演练……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:30","scriptId":20535,"text":"“开什么玩笑，这里只有一条路通往内陆，你们堵在这儿，让我怎么绕路？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:31","scriptId":20535,"text":"“所以说，要不莉安娜你们小队也来帮个忙？可以加快进度。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:32","scriptId":20535,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:33","scriptId":20535,"text":"莉安娜看了看，另外两名队员。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:34","scriptId":20535,"text":"“好吧，速战速决，是实弹还是演习弹？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-PROLOGUE:20535:35","scriptId":20535,"text":"于是死亡彗星小队也加入到了演练战斗之中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:1","scriptId":20536,"text":"“哼，这个男人的队伍不值一提，但蕾贝卡你今天怎么也不在状态。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:2","scriptId":20536,"text":"莉安娜收起了武器，她们的小队赢得了这次演练的最终胜利。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:3","scriptId":20536,"text":"“呃……果然不该派佐伊去做侦察，白白葬送机会……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:4","scriptId":20536,"text":"“我们今天还有急事，没功夫和你们闲扯了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:5","scriptId":20536,"text":"“赢了就跑吗？我还想来第二回合呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:6","scriptId":20536,"text":"“哼，下次吧，今天没时间了。我们还要赶火车，以后还可以赌点什么～不然这种战斗我真是提不起精神。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:7","scriptId":20536,"text":"说完莉安娜就带着她的小队匆匆离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":780,"right":223,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:9","scriptId":20536,"text":"死亡彗星小队没走多久。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:10","scriptId":20536,"text":"“赶火车啊……那基本就确定了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:11","scriptId":20536,"text":"“确定什么？话说这次陪你演习的目的还没告诉我呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:12","scriptId":20536,"text":"“正巧长官在这里休假，所以我觉得没有比长官更合适的人选了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:13","scriptId":20536,"text":"“总觉得你不是在夸我……那目的呢？不要敷衍我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:14","scriptId":20536,"text":"“真是的，本来不想让长官趟这浑水的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:15","scriptId":20536,"text":"“先收队吧～回科研基地，路上再告诉你～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356001-EPILOGUE:20536:16","scriptId":20536,"text":"“好吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":223,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
